{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_10_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_10",
  "title": "夕",
  "storyCode": "WR-10",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6e970f5c0c0cad524c504ac48262ae8ef187b1f234d2bfdf048e507d74a4f182",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "（这里就是......龙门。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "（得赶紧——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "老伯老伯，留步，留步啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，老伯，向您打听个事儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "这附近有没有个叫做董氏鳞丸的摊子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你......不是龙门人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "慕名而来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "诶，当然是慕名而来的，慕名而来嘛，哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "现在都几点了，早就收摊啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你要是真想吃上一口，明天一早八点就得来排队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "收摊了？那您知道那位董师父住在哪儿吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "老伯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "只是吃个鳞丸，犯不着知道他姓甚名谁，家住哪儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃......哈哈哈，说的也是，哈哈......那我还是等明儿再说吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "年轻人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——老、老伯，您这是什么意思？请把手杖挪开——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你找姓董的什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我、我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "我劝你规矩点，年轻人，老实交代吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你这一晚上问了那么多人，从退休的老家伙到灰尾的堂主你全都要找，最后还要来拜访一个卖鳞鱼丸的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "没人会大半夜的来这种地方找他。而且......你拿的东西，我认得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——您、您是！？唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "别乱动，年轻人，先答，你还要找谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "就这么些人！董阿伯是万不得已才要去拜访的人——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你姓廉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不！不不！您听我说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "别动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "我可不会看走眼，你是个练家子的......那把廉家阴晴扇，廉子虚是你什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——是我师父！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "她怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "师父她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "怎么了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "......怎么死的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "为了......为了我这个废物徒弟，被人活活害死的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "......可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "林先生——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "嚯......你知道这个名字，你怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我、我听师父提起过您......求您了，我还不能被他们抓住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你躲到龙门来，苟且偷生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "香火不能断！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你该去近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "当官的管不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "好......念在姓董的和你师父有旧情，我给你这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "让你三招，断了我这根手杖，你就跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——不，不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "师父说过，龙门的林对姓董的有恩，就是对她有恩，无论什么情况，都不能对他不敬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "动手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——不！我不敢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "懦夫！开扇！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "可我不姓廉！我不配用这把扇子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "现在是你拿着它！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "可我不姓廉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "那你师父是白死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "嗯，够利落......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "林先生......得罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "起来，是我让你做的，不用跪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "......你在龙门待五年。五年之后，我把你送回勾吴城，之后的事，你自己打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "乌有哥，你真要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "待在龙门挺好的。不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "该做的事，还是要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看来我们是留不住你了......这最后一杯酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "余着。如果我还能活着回来，我们继续喝这杯酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "到那会，我就不用顶着个假名了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等你回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "你真的回来了，这我倒是没有料到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，话不能这么说，您对我有恩，我怎么能拍拍屁股走人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "呵。总是一副油腔滑调的样子，第一次见面的时候，你可紧张得要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哈、哈哈，林先生，打人不打脸，揭人不揭短嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "之后有什么打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......事虽了，但毕竟得罪了那么多人，想再在家乡待下去也不现实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_034",
      "text": "我有个门面可以盘给你，市中心，价不便宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哪能白拿您的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这就是你的馆子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，俗话说得好呀，和气生财，所以叫“和气”，你看咋样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听上去像是老年人健身中心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "什么时代了，能赚到钱就行！老年人健身中心也挺好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真的会有人来吗......呃，还是年费会员制？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊哈哈......无人问津也未必是坏事嘛，听说最近流行这种......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "打扰了，请问这里是健身馆吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哎哟哟，客官里边请，咱们这可是正统的大炎武术健身，包您身材倍棒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......是这样。你等等，我把银行卡找出来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "乌哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别以为你逃到龙门来就逃得掉，你跑不了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去死啊你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "乌哥！乌哥！你还好吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "你看我......像是还好的样子吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别急，别急，我这就叫救护车——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "别啦，咳咳，咳咳......没救了......我知道。这馆子才刚开张第一天就见血，太不吉利......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我......咳咳，你别哭啊。大男子汉的，哭啥，死个人而已嘛，常见的啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......我没有，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "就这样吧......也就......还行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰尾成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "乌哥！乌哥！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦，你这后半辈子除了给师父报仇，你这啥也没干啊。做个梦还要把自己做死，划不来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我？我刚才不是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "是个啥呀。我要是不找你，你还得从离开勾吴城开始重活一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "起床干活啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......我怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛丝！你来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......米格鲁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "你怎么还......穿着罗德岛的衣服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嘿嘿，虽然是长期休假，不过这身衣服还挺割舍不下嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "你看，这里还不错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......这是你的新家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "要不要在我这儿多呆几天？我会好好招待你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "我们真的有必要从这里走吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "你看那儿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "......嘁，真麻烦，那支商队根本没什么油水可捞，却要惹来这么一大批人，早知道这样，我就不干了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "现在说这些有什么用，喂，把东西搬过来，这里有个不错的地方！记得做好标记！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——是劫匪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嗯，之前就有听信使姐姐说过，最近山里不太平......原来都躲在这儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛丝，我们赶紧回去通报给警备队——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——为什么？我们就可以解决他们呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛丝，别冲动——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "喂，又有车队靠近了！可能是新的商人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "慢吞吞的就来不及啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "诶诶，克洛丝你竟然会说这种话哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "啊，他们好像准备行动了！我来保护——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——嘿咻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "你是——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "呃！？怎么了？他怎么晕倒了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "在这里哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "哇......一瞬间就全部击倒了......而且每一发都避开要害，只是让他们失去了行动能力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "你什么时候变得这么厉害了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "我们去把警备队叫过来吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "呼啊......早啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "早，克洛丝，睡得好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "突然有一天要我早睡，根本睡不着嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "哈哈，不过信使大叔们走得很早嘛，你要搭顺风车，就得早点去啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "欸，别这样嘛，我们只是暂时分开一下下，你随时可以过来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "哦，记得代我向芬问好哦？不知道她现在怎么样了呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "来，你的行李，都替你收拾好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "好啦，别这么哭丧着脸，笑一个！你还要去芬那边呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "下次记得帮我带哥伦比亚的土特产呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "再见啦！克洛丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "再见，米格鲁——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再见。再见。\n你知道事情不是这样。\n你会遇见更糟的事情。\n......\n我......猜到会是你。对不起，我不会让路。我绝对不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......什么？我刚才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "......你醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我们已经......被困在这里很久了，你好像做了个好梦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "没什么好抱歉的......但是口粮已经不够了，克洛丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "我们得赌一把，得翻过山谷去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "已经太久没收到玻利瓦尔本军的消息了，难道说他们换了一条路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "米格鲁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "总之，我们得离开这里。早就过了任务期限了......也得向罗德岛汇报才行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "这不对......不该这样的......紧急通讯还是没有反应！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "可，可根据作战地图，他们的营地应该就在附近啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "喂——！你们在哪儿！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "这、这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......米格鲁......你确定是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "为、为什么？怎么会！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "......详细的报告之后会呈上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "而且......克洛丝，也许这件事我们不该介入太深了......如果玻利瓦尔的情况真的这么复杂......我们，我们帮不了她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "text": "必须回到罗德岛本舰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "那要眼睁睁看着她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——不，我......我......我该拦住她的！无论用什么手段......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊，克洛丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......年小姐，抱歉，我现在没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "原来如此，原来如此，毕竟夕可做不到真的为你们造一段梦境般的人生啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "她只是画出了你们的人生，浮光掠影一般重头再来......你呀，反正都是假的，就不能选个好些的结局吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "你在说什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "没关系，没关系，毕竟有我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "我可是她姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "克洛丝！乌有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......一片漆黑......发生什么了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "刚才好像看见煮伞先生......他把刚点燃的火掐灭了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......发生什么了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "唔，也不知道嵯峨那边怎么样了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......脚下是有地面的，但是也不能轻举妄动啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "呜啊啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "年、年！？你怎么在这儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦，没事儿，我可是货真价实的，我这不是来帮你们了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "只是，哎呀，怎么说呢，这算是被她摆了一道......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我什么都看不见——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——等等，好像有一点点......那边是不是有什么人在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......这是陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "她察觉到了我给你那东西的作用，然后立刻把你们丢进了每个人的黄粱一梦里。但可惜......还是迟了点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这要怎么做到！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "谁知道呢，雕琢出普通人类的神意并不难，毕竟不是给你们塑造一段人生，本质上......只是自问自答似的走马灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "一面镜子，一片湖泊，或是深邃深远的星空，一旦你入了画，就再也挣脱不了，就是这么神通广大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "但为什么唯独小炎熔你例外呢？啊，是因为我们之前一起吃火锅的次数比较多吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "不要因为这种理由就把我卷进这种麻烦事里，谢谢你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......嗯？啊，没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "要不要再听一个故事？我可不是夕那种画地为牢的迂腐家伙，不会太晦涩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "在这种情况下，我觉得我们应该先考虑怎么逃出去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "欸，你真的不想听听工业、人口、源石技术都远没有今天发达的古代，他们是怎么对付真正的巨兽吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你上次用差不多的语调和我说话最后就变成了玄极巨兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "毕竟你还是感兴趣的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我......算了，你说吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "相传在遥远的过去，大炎浩大宽广的疆土之内，有神明存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "某任大炎皇帝看着自己繁荣昌盛的国土，却要饱受天灾人祸之苦，为此深感悲悯，苦思良久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "那位史上饱受争议的真龙，当时正值青年，一腔热血。身为大炎皇帝的他，对着自己的心腹重臣，说了这样一段话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "既然普天之下，莫非王土，率土之滨，莫非王臣。那为何那些高高在上的蛮荒之物，不愿听从大炎子民的意愿，不去维护大炎子民的国土？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......你应该知道，有些国家民俗传说或历史上的“神仙”并不是哲学概念上的虚指。但他们也并非真的那么“高高在上”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "真龙就在群峦深潭之间找到了其中一位，一位傲慢、不屑的神明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "大炎伟岸的历史不过是对方生命中的一小部分......他当然不会听从真龙的意见。他何必要在乎人类的生死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "可问题在于，真龙在乎他的子民和社稷，太在乎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "真龙倾全国之力，御驾亲征。随着真龙号令，多少惊世骇俗的江湖奇人也投入这场惊世骇俗的围猎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "以及......出乎意料的，真龙最初所见的那个崛起之物，它荒唐地背叛了自己的同族与亲僚，它分化了自己的力量，参与了这场旷世罕见的狩猎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "大狩猎后，大炎诛杀了数匹胆敢触怒真龙的“神”，驱逐了所有不愿向真龙俯首的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "血流成河，伏尸万里，大炎付出了惨痛的代价。那位真龙的争议，也由此开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "但他本人其实根本不在乎，这一事业持续了真龙的一生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "等到他垂垂老矣，他找到了最后一只尚停留在炎国土地上，那个曾经帮助过真龙，背叛过亲族，最古老的，最高大的悠久之物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "这个叛徒已经遭受了它应有的报应，同族们在离开大炎之前挫毁了它的气焰，令它傲慢的本质暴露在帝王之师的面前——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "总之，功过相抵，真龙饶它不死，但它必须向大炎臣服。为天地立心，为生民立命，为往圣继绝学，为万世开太平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "从此往后，大炎国祚，只在真龙之手，只在大炎子民之手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "之后，所谓的“神”——那些先于诸国王朝而崛起之物选择了隐藏自己，他们分下自己的种子，赋予碎片权能与灵魂，代行于大地之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......它们依旧在泰拉大地上以各种形式存续着，数量早就大不如前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "但大都学乖了，像现在这样一家人和和睦睦生活在大地各处。嗯，不错的结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "......放眼泰拉诸国的漫长变迁，也从未有任何一个王朝，任何一个人类，能说出“敕封神明”这种话来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "大炎，还是很可怕的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哎呀，总之，我们离开这里吧，我不想在这儿多待一刻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "眼下这幅画可是夕的杀手锏了，也得亏她自己犹犹豫豫，我们才有可乘之机，嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......你、你要怎么做到......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "我们......我们这是怎么了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔，脑袋好沉......嗯？克洛丝恩人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "小乌有......？小炎熔呢？嵯峨呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我也不知道啊，她们......恩、恩人呐，我们是不是，回到灰齐山啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "您是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我只说一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "难道说......你就是，夕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "是年的主意吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我不想知道你们是什么人，也不想知道她和你们是什么关系，与我无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你们回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......莫非之前的那些事情，都是您......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "是又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "对于三番五次扰我清静的无礼之徒，如此惩罚，算轻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......该不会是，因为“爆竹”的事......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "您误会了，我们不是刻意要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "误会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "年骗得了你们，骗不了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "无论她说什么，我都不愿意见她。就这么告诉她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "可是，炎熔和嵯峨呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "她们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "什么......在哪！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啥、啥！？哪来的声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——快趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——你刚才突然造出了个什么玩意！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊，一个大号二踢脚啊。全长八尺宽三尺，采用泰拉前所未见的科技引爆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这么近的距离，你倒是提醒我一下啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "没空啦，再这样又要被她跑掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "你说是吧，我的好妹妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "——你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "你竟然......烧了我的画！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "哦，是这样，打开门的那一瞬间，其实就已经踏入你的画卷天地了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "还是说，登山的途中？或是干脆这座山头，根本就是梦幻泡影罢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "嗨，难怪我根本找不到你，孤僻鬼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "什、什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "是啊，那么小的茅屋怎么放得下那么多东西，你们就没人感觉得到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "唔，好像也对，大部分人的思维和感官也会被影响，意识不到也没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "就像你不管做了什么光怪陆离的梦，你都不会感觉到异样，一个道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "啊哈，被姐姐戳破那点小秘密，就生气了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "我要把你揍回你那陵墓里去，“姐姐”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "欸，那地儿已经毁了啦，好久之前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "哦，那不是正好？给重修一座，这次记得多花点心思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "嚯嚯，还是老样子，脾气上来了就嘴上不饶人......不过，你刚才喊我“姐姐”了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "......是啊，对待将死之人，总是要亲切一些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "别担心，“妹妹”，你赢过我几次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "text": "别这么自信，虚有其表的姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerId": "char_2014_nian",
      "text": "我看倒未必，得意忘形的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——克洛丝，乌有，躲远点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "aliases": [
        "炎熔"
      ]
